      "description": "When this unit is activated, pick one effect until the end of the activation: it gets either \u002B4 inches range when shooting, or moves \u002B2 inches when charging."
    },
    {
      "name": "Piercing Spotter",
      "passive": [],
      "activated": [
        {
          "triggerHook": "Activation_OnBeforeAttackAction",
